 SCENE 2 — Async first contact via the board
======================================================================
  CLAIM: A sender reaches a receiver who is not online. It posts to
  CLAIM: the board while the receiver process is down; the receiver
  CLAIM: starts later, finds its one real notification among decoys,
  CLAIM: and completes the payment. The directory sees only sized
  CLAIM: ciphertext.

  * the board already holds decoy notifications from unrelated
    senders
      decoys resident: 6
  * the receiver process is DOWN — no poll loop is running
