 SCENE 4 — Token upgrade for a returning sender
======================================================================
  CLAIM: The board carries first contact only. After one payment the
  CLAIM: receiver mints a token with its mailbox key; the next
  CLAIM: payment presents it and reaches the queue directly, with no
  CLAIM: board entry and no proof of work, while the mailroom refuses
  CLAIM: posts that carry no token.

