  VERDICT [PASS]: the mailroom refused the stranger's un-tokened post,
                 admitted Frank's tokened frame once, refused the replay,
                 and the return payment left no board entry. The token is
                 minted and verified at the mailroom; the demo transport
                 splices it into the queue post because the stock sender
                 cannot attach one yet.

